    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2023-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">50 local youth, 2 NGOs and 3 scientific entities effectively join the platform.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">A drafted cooperation protocol between EEAA and Fayoum University to co-monitor the natural assets of the Fayoum PAs. The minister of environment is to set a date to attend the signing of the protocol.

A cooperation protocol has been prepared by the consultant to be signed by EEAA and Nature Conservation Egypt NGO (Defining and implementing periodic monitoring programs for the main natural and cultural values in Fayoum PAs, as well as the various components of biodiversity within each PA).</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
